      "year": 2016,
      "abstract": "JANUARY 16, 1948. On January 3 I met with Mr. Żarnecki, director of the Central Board of the Electrotechnical Industry, who informed me that he would be arranging for the Świdnica meter-manufacturing plant to produce a model of an electricity meter appropriate to a quadratic price schedule. Yesterday at the Polytechnic I met with the engineer Metol, the present manager of the plant’s laboratory, to discuss the details. I had known him in Lwów but not seen him these past seven years.",
